\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 Cho m\uc0\u7909 c \u273 \'edch c\u7911 a Ph\u7847 n 3 n\'e0y: (A) B\'ean Thu\'ea L\'e0 Ng\u432 \u7901 i D\'f9ng Cu\u7889 i c\'f3 ngh\u297 a l\'e0 B\'ean Thu\'ea l\'e0 ng\u432 \u7901 i d\'f9ng cu\u7889 i c\'f9ng s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple cho thu\'ea ch\u7881  cho c\'e1c D\u7883 ch V\u7909  C\u7911 a B\'ean Ph\'e1t Tri\u7875 n \u272 \u432 \u7907 c Ph\'e9p; v\'e0 (B) C\'e1c D\u7883 ch V\u7909  C\u7911 a B\'ean Ph\'e1t Tri\u7875 n \u272 \u432 \u7907 c Ph\'e9p c\'f3 ngh\u297 a l\'e0 c\'e1c d\u7883 ch v\u7909  t\'edch h\u7907 p li\'ean t\u7909 c, bao g\u7891 m nh\u432 ng kh\'f4ng gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n \u7903  ph\'e1t tri\u7875 n ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m, x\'e2y d\u7921 ng ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m t\u7915  m\'e3 ngu\u7891 n, th\u7917  nghi\u7879 m t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng trong qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh ph\'e1t tri\u7875 n ph\u7847 n m\u7873 m v\'e0 ch\u7841 y c\'e1c c\'f4ng c\u7909  b\'ean ph\'e1t tri\u7875 n c\u7847 n ti\u7871 t \u273 \u7875  h\u7895  tr\u7907  nh\u7919 ng ho\u7841 t \u273 \u7897 ng \u273 \'f3. M\u7895 i B\'ean Cho Thu\'ea ph\u7843 i cung c\u7845 p cho Apple m\u7897 t th\'f4ng b\'e1o tr\u432 \u7899 c khi cho thu\'ea ho\u7863 c cho thu\'ea l\u7841 i Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple theo Ph\u7847 n 3 n\'e0y b\u7857 ng c\'e1ch li\'ean h\u7879  v\u7899 i b\u7897  ph\u7853 n Quan H\u7879  Nh\'e0 Ph\'e1t Tri\u7875 n Apple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://developer.apple.com/contact/macos-license/"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul \ulc2 https://developer.apple.com/contact/macos-license/}}).\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
