\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 F. M\uc0\u7897 t s\u7889  Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909  nh\u7845 t \u273 \u7883 nh c\'f3 th\u7875  hi\u7875 n th\u7883 , ch\u7913 a \u273 \u7921 ng ho\u7863 c cung c\u7845 p n\u7897 i dung, d\u7919  li\u7879 u, th\'f4ng tin, \u7913 ng d\u7909 ng ho\u7863 c t\'e0i li\u7879 u t\u7915  b\'ean th\u7913  ba (\'93T\'e0i Li\u7879 u C\u7911 a B\'ean Th\u7913  Ba\'94) ho\u7863 c cung c\u7845 p li\'ean k\u7871 t t\u7899 i m\u7897 t s\u7889  trang web c\u7911 a b\'ean th\u7913  ba. B\u7857 ng vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909 , b\u7841 n x\'e1c nh\u7853 n v\'e0 \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng Apple s\u7869  kh\'f4ng c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m ki\u7875 m tra ho\u7863 c \u273 \'e1nh gi\'e1 n\u7897 i dung, \u273 \u7897  ch\'ednh x\'e1c, t\'ednh ho\'e0n ch\u7881 nh, t\'ednh k\u7883 p th\u7901 i, t\'ednh h\u7907 p l\u7879 , s\u7921  tu\'e2n th\u7911  quy \u273 \u7883 nh v\u7873  b\u7843 n quy\u7873 n, t\'ednh h\u7907 p ph\'e1p, s\u7921  tu\'e2n th\u7911  quy t\u7855 c, ch\u7845 t l\u432 \u7907 ng ho\u7863 c nh\u7919 ng kh\'eda c\u7841 nh kh\'e1c trong c\'e1c trang web ho\u7863 c T\'e0i Li\u7879 u C\u7911 a B\'ean Th\u7913  Ba. Apple, c\'e1c nh\'e2n vi\'ean, \u273 \u417 n v\u7883  li\'ean k\u7871 t v\'e0 c\'f4ng ty con c\u7911 a Apple kh\'f4ng b\u7843 o \u273 \u7843 m ho\u7863 c x\'e1c nh\u7853 n c\u361 ng nh\u432  kh\'f4ng ch\u7883 u v\'e0 s\u7869  kh\'f4ng c\'f3 b\u7845 t k\u7923  tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m ph\'e1p l\'fd ho\u7863 c tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m n\'e0o \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i b\u7841 n ho\u7863 c b\u7845 t k\u7923  ng\u432 \u7901 i n\'e0o kh\'e1c v\u7873  c\'e1c D\u7883 ch V\u7909  c\u7911 a b\'ean th\u7913  ba, trang web ho\u7863 c T\'e0i Li\u7879 u C\u7911 a B\'ean Th\u7913  Ba, hay b\u7845 t k\u7923  t\'e0i li\u7879 u, s\u7843 n ph\u7849 m ho\u7863 c d\u7883 ch v\u7909  kh\'e1c c\u7911 a c\'e1c b\'ean th\u7913  ba. T\'e0i Li\u7879 u C\u7911 a B\'ean Th\u7913  Ba v\'e0 c\'e1c li\'ean k\u7871 t t\u7899 i c\'e1c trang web kh\'e1c \u273 \u432 \u7907 c cung c\u7845 p v\u7899 i m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch duy nh\u7845 t l\'e0 t\u7841 o s\u7921  thu\u7853 n l\u7907 i cho b\u7841 n.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
