\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 G. C\uc0\u7843  Apple v\'e0 c\'e1c b\'ean cung c\u7845 p n\u7897 i dung cho Apple \u273 \u7873 u kh\'f4ng b\u7843 o \u273 \u7843 m v\u7873  t\'ecnh tr\u7841 ng s\u7861 n c\'f3, \u273 \u7897  ch\'ednh x\'e1c, t\'ednh ho\'e0n ch\u7881 nh, \u273 \u7897  tin c\u7853 y ho\u7863 c t\'ednh k\u7883 p th\u7901 i c\u7911 a th\'f4ng tin l\u432 u tr\u7919 , d\u7919  li\u7879 u \u273 \u7883 nh v\u7883 , d\u7919  li\u7879 u s\u7913 c kh\u7887 e ho\u7863 c b\u7845 t k\u7923  d\u7919  li\u7879 u n\'e0o kh\'e1c m\'e0 b\u7845 t k\u7923  Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909  n\'e0o hi\u7875 n th\u7883 . Th\'f4ng tin t\'e0i ch\'ednh do b\u7845 t k\u7923  Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909  n\'e0o hi\u7875 n th\u7883  ch\u7881  d\'e0nh cho m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch cung c\u7845 p th\'f4ng tin n\'f3i chung v\'e0 kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c coi l\'e0 l\u7901 i khuy\'ean t\u432  v\u7845 n \u273 \u7847 u t\u432 . Tr\u432 \u7899 c khi ti\u7871 n h\'e0nh b\u7845 t k\u7923  giao d\u7883 ch ch\u7913 ng kho\'e1n n\'e0o d\u7921 a tr\'ean th\'f4ng tin thu nh\u7853 n \u273 \u432 \u7907 c th\'f4ng qua Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909 , b\u7841 n n\'ean tham v\u7845 n chuy\'ean gia t\'e0i ch\'ednh ho\u7863 c ch\u7913 ng kho\'e1n c\'f3 tr\'ecnh \u273 \u7897  chuy\'ean m\'f4n theo quy \u273 \u7883 nh c\u7911 a ph\'e1p lu\u7853 t \u273 \u7875  \u273 \u432 a ra c\'e1c t\u432  v\u7845 n v\u7873  t\'e0i ch\'ednh ho\u7863 c ch\u7913 ng kho\'e1n t\u7841 i qu\u7889 c gia ho\u7863 c khu v\u7921 c c\u7911 a b\u7841 n. B\u7841 n n\'ean \u273 \'e1nh gi\'e1 t\'ednh ch\'ednh x\'e1c v\'e0 s\u7921  ph\'f9 h\u7907 p c\u7911 a c\'e1c k\u7871 t qu\u7843  \u273 \u7847 u ra do tr\'ed tu\u7879  nh\'e2n t\u7841 o t\u7841 o ra \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p s\u7917  d\u7909 ng c\u7911 a b\u7841 n, trong \u273 \'f3 c\'f3 vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng \u273 \'e1nh gi\'e1 c\u7911 a con ng\u432 \u7901 i khi th\'edch h\u7907 p, tr\u432 \u7899 c khi s\u7917  d\u7909 ng ho\u7863 c chia s\u7867  k\u7871 t qu\u7843  nh\u7853 n \u273 \u432 \u7907 c t\u7915  Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909 . D\u7919  li\u7879 u \u273 \u7883 nh v\u7883  do b\u7845 t k\u7923  Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909  cung c\u7845 p, bao g\u7891 m c\u7843  d\u7883 ch v\u7909  B\u7843 n \u272 \u7891  Apple, ch\u7881  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c cung c\u7845 p cho m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch \u273 i\u7873 u h\u432 \u7899 ng v\'e0 l\'ean k\u7871  ho\u7841 ch c\u417  b\u7843 n, kh\'f4ng nh\u7857 m \u273 \u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng trong c\'e1c tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p c\u7847 n ph\u7843 i c\'f3 c\'e1c th\'f4ng tin \u273 \u7883 nh v\u7883  ch\'ednh x\'e1c ho\u7863 c tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p vi\u7879 c d\u7919  li\u7879 u \u273 \u7883 nh v\u7883  b\u7883  l\u7895 i, kh\'f4ng ch\'ednh x\'e1c, b\u7883  ch\u7853 m tr\u7877  ho\u7863 c kh\'f4ng \u273 \u7847 y \u273 \u7911  c\'f3 th\u7875  g\'e2y t\u7917  vong, th\u432 \u417 ng t\u7853 t c\'e1 nh\'e2n hay thi\u7879 t h\u7841 i v\u7873  t\'e0i s\u7843 n ho\u7863 c m\'f4i tr\u432 \u7901 ng. B\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng c\'e1c k\u7871 t qu\u7843  m\'e0 b\u7841 n nh\u7853 n \u273 \u432 \u7907 c t\u7915  d\u7883 ch v\u7909  B\u7843 n \u272 \u7891  c\'f3 th\u7875  kh\'e1c so v\u7899 i \u273 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n \u273 \u432 \u7901 ng s\'e1 ho\u7863 c \u273 \u7883 a h\'ecnh c\u7909  th\u7875  do c\'e1c y\u7871 u t\u7889  c\'f3 th\u7875  \u7843 nh h\u432 \u7903 ng \u273 \u7871 n \u273 \u7897  ch\'ednh x\'e1c c\u7911 a d\u7919  li\u7879 u B\u7843 n \u272 \u7891 , v\'ed d\u7909  nh\u432  c\'e1c y\u7871 u t\u7889  th\u7901 i ti\u7871 t, \u273 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n \u273 \u432 \u7901 ng s\'e1 v\'e0 giao th\'f4ng, c\'e1c s\u7921  ki\u7879 n \u273 \u7883 a ch\'ednh tr\u7883 . \u272 \u7875  b\u7843 o \u273 \u7843 m an to\'e0n cho b\u7841 n, b\u7841 n c\u7847 n lu\'f4n ch\'fa \'fd \u273 \u7871 n c\'e1c bi\u7875 n ch\u7881  \u273 \u432 \u7901 ng v\'e0 \u273 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n \u273 \u432 \u7901 ng x\'e1 hi\u7879 n t\u7841 i. Tu\'e2n theo lu\u7853 t giao th\'f4ng v\'e0 th\'f4ng l\u7879  l\'e1i xe an to\'e0n, \u273 \u7891 ng th\u7901 i l\u432 u \'fd r\u7857 ng c\'e1c ch\u7881  d\u7851 n cho ng\u432 \u7901 i \u273 i b\u7897  v\'e0 \u273 \u7841 p xe c\'f3 th\u7875  kh\'f4ng ch\u7913 a th\'f4ng tin v\u7873  c\'e1c l\u7889 i \u273 i \u273 \'e3 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c x\'e1c \u273 \u7883 nh.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
