\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 H. Trong ph\uc0\u7841 m vi b\u7841 n truy\u7873 n t\u7843 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  n\u7897 i dung n\'e0o th\'f4ng qua vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909 , b\u7841 n tuy\'ean b\u7889  r\u7857 ng b\u7841 n s\u7903  h\u7919 u t\u7845 t c\u7843  c\'e1c quy\u7873 n \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i n\u7897 i dung \u273 \'f3, ho\u7863 c b\u7841 n c\'f3 th\u7849 m quy\u7873 n ho\u7863 c \u273 \u432 \u7907 c cho ph\'e9p m\u7897 t c\'e1ch h\u7907 p ph\'e1p theo c\'e1ch kh\'e1c \u273 \u7875  truy\u7873 n t\u7843 i n\u7897 i dung \u273 \'f3 v\'e0 n\u7897 i dung \u273 \'f3 kh\'f4ng vi ph\u7841 m b\u7845 t k\u7923  \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n d\u7883 ch v\u7909  n\'e0o \'e1p d\u7909 ng cho Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909 . B\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909  ch\u7913 a \u273 \u7921 ng n\u7897 i dung, th\'f4ng tin v\'e0 t\'e0i li\u7879 u \u273 \u7897 c quy\u7873 n thu\u7897 c quy\u7873 n s\u7903  h\u7919 u c\u7911 a Apple, ch\u7911  s\u7903  h\u7919 u trang web ho\u7863 c c\'e1c b\'ean c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n s\u7917  d\u7909 ng c\u7911 a Apple v\'e0 ch\u7911  s\u7903  h\u7919 u trang web, \u273 \u7891 ng th\u7901 i \u273 \u432 \u7907 c b\u7843 o v\u7879  b\u7903 i quy\u7873 n s\u7903  h\u7919 u tr\'ed tu\u7879  hi\u7879 n h\'e0nh v\'e0 c\'e1c lu\u7853 t kh\'e1c, bao g\u7891 m nh\u432 ng kh\'f4ng gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n \u7903  lu\u7853 t b\u7843 n quy\u7873 n. B\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng b\u7841 n s\u7869  kh\'f4ng s\u7917  d\u7909 ng c\'e1c n\u7897 i dung, th\'f4ng tin ho\u7863 c t\'e0i li\u7879 u \u273 \u7897 c quy\u7873 n \u273 \'f3 ngo\'e0i m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch s\u7917  d\u7909 ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c ph\'e9p c\u7911 a Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909  ho\u7863 c theo c\'e1ch th\u7913 c tr\'e1i v\u7899 i c\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n c\u7911 a H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Quy\u7873 n S\u7917  D\u