\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 I. M\uc0\u7897 t s\u7889  Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple, D\u7883 ch V\u7909  v\'e0 T\'e0i Li\u7879 u C\u7911 a B\'ean Th\u7913  Ba c\'f3 th\u7875  kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c cung c\u7845 p \u7903  m\u7897 t s\u7889  ng\'f4n ng\u7919  ho\u7863 c qu\u7889 c gia hay khu v\u7921 c. Apple kh\'f4ng tuy\'ean b\u7889  r\u7857 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple, D\u7883 ch V\u7909  v\'e0 T\'e0i Li\u7879 u C\u7911 a B\'ean Th\u7913  Ba l\'e0 ph\'f9 h\u7907 p ho\u7863 c s\u7861 n c\'f3 \u273 \u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng t\u7841 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  \u273 \u7883 a \u273 i\u7875 m c\u7909  th\u7875  n\'e0o. Trong ph\u7841 m vi m\'e0 b\u7841 n l\u7921 a ch\u7885 n s\u7917  d\u7909 ng ho\u7863 c truy c\u7853 p Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple, D\u7883 ch V\u7909  ho\u7863 c T\'e0i Li\u7879 u C\u7911 a B\'ean Th\u7913  Ba n\'e0y, b\u7841 n s\u7869  t\u7921  m\'ecnh th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n v\'e0 t\u7921  ch\u7883 u tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m v\u7873  vi\u7879 c tu\'e2n th\u7911  c\'e1c lu\u7853 t hi\u7879 n h\'e0nh, bao g\u7891 m nh\u432 ng kh\'f4ng gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n \u7903  lu\u7853 t \u273 \u7883 a ph\u432 \u417 ng hi\u7879 n h\'e0nh c\u361 ng nh\u432  c\'e1c lu\u7853 t v\u7873  quy\u7873 n ri\'eang t\u432  v\'e0 thu th\u7853 p d\u7919  li\u7879 u. Apple v\'e0 c\'e1c b\'ean c\u7845 p quy\u7873 n s\u7917  d\u7909 ng c\u7911 a Apple b\u7843 o l\u432 u quy\u7873 n thay \u273 \u7893 i, t\u7841 m ng\u7915 ng, x\'f3a b\u7887  ho\u7863 c v\'f4 hi\u7879 u h\'f3a quy\u7873 n truy c\u7853 p v\'e0o Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909  t\u7841 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  th\u7901 i \u273 i\u7875 m n\'e0o m\'e0 kh\'f4ng c\u7847 n th\'f4ng b\'e1o. Trong m\u7885 i tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p, Apple s\u7869  kh\'f4ng ch\u7883 u tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m ph\'e1p l\'fd v\u7873  vi\u7879 c x\'f3a b\u7887  ho\u7863 c v\'f4 hi\u7879 u h\'f3a quy\u7873 n truy c\u7853 p v\'e0o Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909  \u273 \'f3. Trong m\u7885 i tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p, Apple c\u361 ng c\'f3 th\u7875  \'e1p \u273 \u7863 t gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng ho\u7863 c truy c\u7853 p v\'e0o m\u7897 t s\u7889  Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 D\u7883 ch V\u7909  nh\u7845 t \u273 \u7883 nh m\'e0 kh\'f4ng c\u7847 n th\'f4ng b\'e1o ho\u7863 c ch\u7883 u tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m ph\'e1p l\'fd.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
