\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 A. N\uc0\u7871 u b\u7841 n l\'e0 m\u7897 t kh\'e1ch h\'e0ng ti\'eau d\'f9ng (b\u7841 n s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple kh\'f4ng cho m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch kinh doanh, th\u432 \u417 ng m\u7841 i ho\u7863 c ngh\u7873  nghi\u7879 p) th\'ec b\u7841 n c\'f3 th\u7875  c\'f3 c\'e1c quy\u7873 n h\u7907 p ph\'e1p t\u7841 i qu\u7889 c gia b\u7841 n c\u432  tr\'fa m\'e0 c\'f3 th\u7875  c\u7845 m \'e1p d\u7909 ng c\'e1c h\u7841 n ch\u7871  sau \u273 \'e2y \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i b\u7841 n, v\'e0 trong tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p \u273 \'f3, c\'e1c h\u7841 n ch\u7871  sau \u273 \'e2y s\u7869  kh\'f4ng \'e1p d\u7909 ng \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i b\u7841 n. \u272 \u7875  bi\u7871 t th\'eam v\u7873  c\'e1c quy\u7873 n, b\u7841 n n\'ean li\'ean h\u7879  v\u7899 i t\u7893  ch\u7913 c t\u432  v\u7845 n cho ng\u432 \u7901 i ti\'eau d\'f9ng t\u7841 i \u273 \u7883 a ph\u432 \u417 ng. \u272 \u7889 i v\u7899 i ng\u432 \u7901 i ti\'eau d\'f9ng t\u7841 i \'dac, kh\'f4ng c\'f3 n\u7897 i dung n\'e0o trong H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Ph\'e9p S\u7917  D\u7909 ng n\'e0y s\u7869  \u7843 nh h\u432 \u7903 ng ho\u7863 c nh\u7857 m \u7843 nh h\u432 \u7903 ng \u273 \u7871 n c\'e1c quy\u7873 n theo lu\u7853 t \u273 \u7883 nh c\u7911 a b\u7841 n theo Lu\u7853 t Ti\'eau D\'f9ng \'dac (bao g\u7891 m c\u7843  b\u7843 o \u273 \u7843 m cho ng\u432 \u7901 i ti\'eau d\'f9ng).\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
