\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 B. TRONG PH\uc0\u7840 M VI LU\u7852 T HI\u7878 N H\'c0NH CHO PH\'c9P, B\u7840 N C\'d4NG KHAI X\'c1C NH\u7852 N V\'c0 \u272 \u7890 NG \'dd CH\u7882 U M\u7884 I R\u7910 I RO TRONG VI\u7878 C S\u7916  D\u7908 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE V\'c0 B\u7844 T K\u7922  D\u7882 CH V\u7908  N\'c0O \u272 \u431 \u7906 C TH\u7920 C HI\u7878 N B\u7902 I HO\u7862 C \u272 \u431 \u7906 C TRUY C\u7852 P TH\'d4NG QUA PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE V\'c0 B\u7840 N HO\'c0N TO\'c0N CH\u7882 U M\u7884 I R\u7910 I RO V\u7872  CH\u7844 T L\u431 \u7906 NG TH\u7886 A \u272 \'c1NG, KH\u7842  N\u258 NG HO\u7840 T \u272 \u7896 NG, \u272 \u7896  CH\'cdNH X\'c1C V\'c0 K\u7870 T QU\u7842  NH\u7852 N \u272 \u431 \u7906 C.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
