\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 E. B\uc0\u7840 N X\'c1C NH\u7852 N TH\'caM R\u7856 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE V\'c0 D\u7882 CH V\u7908  KH\'d4NG \u272 \u431 \u7906 C T\u7840 O RA \u272 \u7874  HO\u7862 C KH\'d4NG PH\'d9 H\u7906 P CHO VI\u7878 C S\u7916  D\u7908 NG TRONG C\'c1C \u272 I\u7872 U KI\u7878 N HO\u7862 C M\'d4I TR\u431 \u7900 NG TRONG \u272 \'d3 VI\u7878 C N\u7896 I DUNG, D\u7918  LI\u7878 U HO\u7862 C TH\'d4NG TIN DO PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE HO\u7862 C D\u7882 CH V\u7908  CUNG C\u7844 P B\u7882  SAI S\'d3T, CH\u7852 M TR\u7876 , C\'d3 L\u7894 I HAY KH\'d4NG CH\'cdNH X\'c1C C\'d3 TH\u7874  G\'c2Y T\u7916  VONG, TH\u431 \u416 NG T\u7852 T C\'c1 NH\'c2N HO\u7862 C THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I NGHI\'caM TR\u7884 NG V\u7872  V\u7852 T CH\u7844 T HO\u7862 C M\'d4I TR\u431 \u7900 NG, BAO G\u7890 M NH\u431 NG KH\'d4NG GI\u7898 I H\u7840 N \u7902  HO\u7840 T \u272 \u7896 NG C\u7910 A C\'c1C C\u416  S\u7902  H\u7840 T NH\'c2N, H\u7878  TH\u7888 NG TH\'d4NG TIN LI\'caN L\u7840 C HO\u7862 C \u272 I\u7872 U H\u431 \u7898 NG M\'c1Y BAY, H\u7878  TH\u7888 NG \u272 I\u7872 U KHI\u7874 N KH\'d4NG L\u431 U, C\u7912 U H\u7896  HO\u7862 C H\u7878  TH\u7888 NG V\u360  KH\'cd.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\
