\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 F. KH\'d4NG C\'d3 B\uc0\u7844 T K\u7922  TH\'d4NG TIN HO\u7862 C L\u7900 I T\u431  V\u7844 N N\'c0O B\u7856 NG V\u258 N B\u7842 N HO\u7862 C B\u7856 NG MI\u7878 NG C\u7910 A APPLE HO\u7862 C M\u7896 T \u272 \u7840 I \u272 I\u7878 N \u272 \u431 \u7906 C \u7910 Y QUY\u7872 N C\u7910 A APPLE C\'d3 TH\u7874  T\u7840 O RA M\u7896 T B\u7842 O \u272 \u7842 M. N\u7870 U PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE HO\u7862 C D\u7882 CH V\u7908  C\'d3 L\u7894 I TH\'cc B\u7840 N S\u7868  CH\u7882 U TO\'c0N B\u7896  CHI PH\'cd CHO M\u7884 I HO\u7840 T \u272 \u7896 NG B\u7842 O D\u431 \u7904 NG, S\u7916 A CH\u7918 A HO\u7862 C KH\'d4I PH\u7908 C C\u7846 N THI\u7870 T. M\u7896 T S\u7888  KHU V\u7920 C PH\'c1P L\'dd KH\'d4NG CHO PH\'c9P LO\u7840 I TR\u7914  C\'c1C B\u7842 O \u272 \u7842 M NG\u7846 M \u272 \u7882 NH HO\u7862 C H\u7840 N CH\u7870  V\u7872  QUY\u7872 N C\u7910 A NG\u431 \u7900 I TI\'caU D\'d9NG THEO QUY \u272 \u7882 NH \'c1P D\u7908 NG. V\'cc V\u7852 Y, C\'c1C \u272 I\u7872 U KHO\u7842 N LO\u7840 I TR\u7914  V\'c0 H\u7840 N CH\u7870  TR\'caN C\'d3 TH\u7874  KH\'d4NG \'c1P D\u7908 NG CHO B\u7840 N.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
