\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 9. Gi\uc0\u7899 i H\u7841 n Tr\'e1ch Nhi\u7879 m Ph\'e1p L\'fd.
\f1\b0  NGO\uc0\u7840 I TR\u7914  TR\u431 \u7900 NG H\u7906 P \u272 \u431 \u7906 C QUY \u272 \u7882 NH TRONG H\u7906 P \u272 \u7890 NG C\u7844 P PH\'c9P S\u7916  D\u7908 NG N\'c0Y, TRONG PH\u7840 M VI LU\u7852 T HI\u7878 N H\'c0NH KH\'d4NG C\u7844 M, APPLE, C\'c1C \u272 \u416 N V\u7882  LI\'caN K\u7870 T, \u272 \u7840 I L\'dd HO\u7862 C B\'caN \u7910 Y NHI\u7878 M C\u7910 A APPLE S\u7868  KH\'d4NG C\'d3 TR\'c1CH NHI\u7878 M PH\'c1P L\'dd TRONG B\u7844 T K\u7922  TR\u431 \u7900 NG H\u7906 P N\'c0O \u272 \u7888 I V\u7898 I TH\u431 \u416 NG T\u7852 T C\'c1 NH\'c2N HO\u7862 C B\u7844 T K\u7922  THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I MANG T\'cdNH NG\u7850 U NHI\'caN, \u272 \u7862 C BI\u7878 T, GI\'c1N TI\u7870 P HO\u7862 C DO H\u7852 U QU\u7842  N\'c0O, BAO G\u7890 M NH\u431 NG KH\'d4NG GI\u7898 I H\u7840 N \u7902  C\'c1C THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I DO T\u7892 N TH\u7844 T V\u7872  L\u7906 I NHU\u7852 N, H\u7886 NG HO\u7862 C M\u7844 T D\u7918  LI\u7878 U, KH\'d4NG TH\u7874  TRUY\u7872 N HO\u7862 C NH\u7852 N B\u7844 T K\u7922  D\u7918  LI\u7878 U N\'c0O (BAO G\u7890 M NH\u431 NG KH\'d4NG GI\u7898 I H\u7840 N \u7902  C\'c1C H\u431 \u7898 NG D\u7850 N V\u7872  KH\'d3A H\u7884 C, B\'c0I T\u7852 P V\'c0 T\'c0I LI\u7878 U KH\'d3A H\u7884 C), S\u7920  C\u7888  GI\'c1N \u272 O\u7840 N KINH DOANH HO\u7862 C B\u7844 T K\u7922  THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I HAY T\u7892 N TH\u7844 T TH\u431 \u416 NG M\u7840 I N\'c0O KH\'c1C, PH\'c1T SINH T\u7914  HO\u7862 C LI\'caN QUAN \u272 \u7870 N VI\u7878 C B\u7840 N S\u7916  D\u7908 NG HO\u7862 C KH\'d4NG TH\u7874  S\u7916  D\u7908 NG PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE V\'c0 D\u7882 CH V\u7908  HO\u7862 C B\u7844 T K\u7922  PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M, \u7912 NG D\u7908 NG HO\u7862 C D\u7882 CH V\u7908  C\u7910 A B\'caN TH\u7912  BA N\'c0O C\'d3 LI\'caN QUAN \u272 \u7870 N PH\u7846 N M\u7872 M APPLE HO\u7862 C D\u7882 CH V\u7908 , CHO D\'d9 THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I HAY T\u7892 N TH\u7844 T \u272 \'d3 B\u7854 T NGU\u7890 N T\u7914  NGUY\'caN NH\'c2N N\'c0O, B\u7844 T K\u7874  TR\'c1CH NHI\u7878 M PH\'c1T SINH THEO H\'ccNH TH\u7912 C N\'c0O (THEO H\u7906 P \u272 \u7890 NG, NGO\'c0I H\u7906 P \u272 \u7890 NG HO\u7862 C THEO NGUY\'caN T\u7854 C N\'c0O KH\'c1C) V\'c0 NGAY C\u7842  KHI APPLE \u272 \'c3 \u272 \u431 \u7906 C KHUY\u7870 N C\'c1O V\u7872  KH\u7842  N\u258 NG X\u7842 Y RA C\'c1C THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I \u272 \'d3. M\u7896 T S\u7888  KHU V\u7920 C PH\'c1P L\'dd KH\'d4NG CHO PH\'c9P LO\u7840 I TR\u7914  HO\u7862 C H\u7840 N CH\u7870  TR\'c1CH NHI\u7878 M PH\'c1P L\'dd \u272 \u7888 I V\u7898 I TH\u431 \u416 NG T\u7852 T C\'c1 NH\'c2N, THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I NG\u7850 U NHI\'caN HAY C\'d3 T\'cdNH H\u7852 U QU\u7842 . V\'cc V\u7852 Y, H\u7840 N CH\u7870  N\'c0Y C\'d3 TH\u7874  KH\'d4NG \'c1P D\u7908 NG \u272 \u7888 I V\u7898 I B\u7840 N. Trong m\u7885 i tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p, t\u7893 ng tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m ph\'e1p l\'fd c\u7911 a Apple \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i c\'e1c thi\u7879 t h\u7841 i x\u7843 y ra v\u7899 i b\u7841 n (tr\u7915  tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p lu\u7853 t \'e1p d\u7909 ng y\'eau c\u7847 u trong c\'e1c tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p li\'ean quan t\u7899 i th\u432 \u417 ng t\u7853 t c\'e1 nh\'e2n) kh\'f4ng v\u432 \u7907 t qu\'e1 hai tr\u259 m n\u259 m m\u432 \u417 i \u273 \'f4 la M\u7929  (250 USD). C\'e1c quy \u273 \u7883 nh gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n tr\'ean s\u7869  \'e1p d\u7909 ng ngay c\u7843  khi bi\u7879 n ph\'e1p kh\u7855 c ph\u7909 c n\'eau tr\'ean kh\'f4ng \u273 \u7841 t \u273 \u432 \u7907 c m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch ch\'ednh. B\u7844 T K\u7874  C\'c1C \u272 I\u7872 U KHO\u7842 N KH\'c1C TRONG H\u7906 P \u272 \u7890 NG C\u7844 P QUY\u7872 N S\u7916  D\u7908 NG N\'c0Y, N\u7870 U \u272 \u7840 O LU\u7852 T H\u7906 P \u272 \u7890 NG TI\'caU D\'d9NG C\u7910 A NH\u7852 T B\u7842 N \u272 \u431 \u7906 C \'c1P D\u7908 NG TH\'cc C\'c1C \u272 I\u7872 U KHO\u7842 N H\u7840 N CH\u7870  TR\'c1CH NHI\u7878 M PH\'c1P L\'dd C\u7910 A APPLE \u272 \u7888 I V\u7898 I C\'c1C THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I PH\'c1T SINH T\u7914  VI\u7878 C VI PH\u7840 M H\u7906 P \u272 \u7890 NG HO\u7862 C SAI L\u7846 M D\'c2N S\u7920  DO APPLE TH\u7920 C HI\u7878 N S\u7868  KH\'d4NG \'c1P D\u7908 NG N\u7870 U THI\u7878 T H\u7840 I \u272 \'d3 L\'c0 DO H\'c0NH VI SAI TR\'c1I C\u7888  \'dd HO\u7862 C S\u416  SU\u7844 T NGHI\'caM TR\u7884 NG C\u7910 A APPLE.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\
\

\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 10. Qu\uc0\u7843 n L\'fd Xu\u7845 t Kh\u7849 u. 
\f1\b0 B\uc0\u7841 n kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng ho\u7863 c b\u7857 ng c\'e1ch n\'e0o \u273 \'f3 xu\u7845 t kh\u7849 u ho\u7863 c t\'e1i xu\u7845 t kh\u7849 u Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple tr\u7915  phi \u273 \u432 \u7907 c cho ph\'e9p theo lu\u7853 t c\u7911 a Hoa K\u7923  v\'e0 lu\u7853 t c\u7911 a (c\'e1c) khu v\u7921 c ph\'e1p l\'fd m\'e0 t\u7841 i \u273 \'f3 Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple \u273 \u432 \u7907 c mua. C\u7909  th\u7875  l\'e0, nh\u432 ng kh\'f4ng h\u7841 n ch\u7871 , kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c xu\u7845 t kh\u7849 u ho\u7863 c t\'e1i xu\u7845 t kh\u7849 u Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0o (a) b\u7845 t k\u7923  qu\u7889 c gia n\'e0o b\u7883  Hoa K\u7923  c\u7845 m v\u7853 n ho\u7863 c (b) b\u7845 t k\u7923  \u273 \u7889 i t\u432 \u7907 ng n\'e0o trong danh s\'e1ch C\'e1c \u272 \u7889 i T\u432 \u7907 ng B\u7883  \u272 \u7889 i X\u7917  \u272 \u7863 c Bi\u7879 t c\u7911 a B\u7897  Ng\'e2n Kh\u7889  Hoa K\u7923  ho\u7863 c Danh S\'e1ch Nh\u7919 ng T\u7893  Ch\u7913 c ho\u7863 c C\'e1 Nh\'e2n B\u7883  Kh\u432 \u7899 c T\u7915  c\u7911 a B\u7897  Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i Hoa K\u7923  ho\u7863 c b\u7845 t k\u7923  danh s\'e1ch \u273 \u7889 i t\u432 \u7907 ng b\u7883  h\u7841 n ch\u7871  n\'e0o kh\'e1c. B\u7857 ng vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple, b\u7841 n cam k\u7871 t v\'e0 b\u7843 o \u273 \u7843 m r\u7857 ng b\u7841 n kh\'f4ng \u7903  t\u7841 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  qu\u7889 c gia n\'e0o ho\u7863 c n\u7857 m trong b\u7845 t k\u7923  danh s\'e1ch n\'e0o n\'eau tr\'ean. B\u7841 n c\u361 ng \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng b\u7841 n s\u7869  kh\'f4ng s\u7917  d\u7909 ng Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple cho b\u7845 t k\u7923  m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch n\'e0o b\u7883  lu\u7853 t Hoa K\u7923  c\u7845 m, bao g\u7891 m v\'e0 kh\'f4ng gi\u7899 i h\u7841 n \u7903  vi\u7879 c ph\'e1t tri\u7875 n, thi\u7871 t k\u7871 , ch\u7871  t\u7841 o ho\u7863 c s\u7843 n xu\u7845 t t\'ean l\u7917 a, v\u361  kh\'ed h\u7841 t nh\'e2n, h\'f3a h\u7885 c ho\u7863 c sinh h\u7885 c.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\
\

\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 11. Ng\uc0\u432 \u7901 i D\'f9ng Cu\u7889 i L\'e0 Ch\'ednh Ph\u7911 .
\f1\b0  Ph\uc0\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 t\'e0i li\u7879 u li\'ean quan l\'e0 \'93C\'e1c S\u7843 n Ph\u7849 m Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i\'94, nh\u432  \u273 \u7883 nh ngh\u297 a c\u7911 a thu\u7853 t ng\u7919  n\'e0y t\u7841 i m\u7909 c 48 C.F.R. \'a72.101, bao g\u7891 m \'93Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m M\'e1y T\'ednh Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i\'94 v\'e0 \'93T\'e0i Li\u7879 u Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m M\'e1y T\'ednh Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i\'94, nh\u432  \u273 \u7883 nh ngh\u297 a c\u7911 a thu\u7853 t ng\u7919  n\'e0y t\u7841 i m\u7909 c 48 C.F.R. \'a712.212 ho\u7863 c m\u7909 c 48 C.F.R. \'a7227.7202, khi \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \'e1p d\u7909 ng. Ph\'f9 h\u7907 p v\u7899 i quy \u273 \u7883 nh t\u7841 i m\u7909 c 48 C.F.R. \'a712.212 ho\u7863 c m\u7909 c 48 C.F.R. \'a7227.7202-1 \u273 \u7871 n m\u7909 c 227.7202-4, khi \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \'e1p d\u7909 ng, Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m M\'e1y T\'ednh Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i v\'e0 T\'e0i Li\u7879 u Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m M\'e1y T\'ednh Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\u7845 p ph\'e9p cho nh\u7919 ng ng\u432 \u7901 i d\'f9ng cu\u7889 i l\'e0 Ch\'ednh Ph\u7911  Hoa K\u7923  (a) ch\u7881  nh\u432  C\'e1c S\u7843 n Ph\u7849 m Th\u432 \u417 ng M\u7841 i v\'e0 (b) ch\u7881  v\u7899 i c\'e1c quy\u7873 n nh\u432  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\u7845 p cho t\u7845 t c\u7843  nh\u7919 ng ng\u432 \u7901 i d\'f9ng cu\u7889 i kh\'e1c theo c\'e1c \u273 i\u7873 u kho\u7843 n v\'e0 \u273 i\u7873 u ki\u7879 n \u273 \u432 \u7907 c n\'eau trong H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Quy\u7873 n S\u7917  D\u7909 ng n\'e0y. C\'e1c quy\u7873 n kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c c\'f4ng b\u7889  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c b\u7843 o l\u432 u theo lu\u7853 t b\u7843 n quy\u7873 n c\u7911 a Hoa K\u7923 .\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\
\

\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 12. Lu\uc0\u7853 t \u272 i\u7873 u Ch\u7881 nh v\'e0 V\'f4 Hi\u7879 u T\u7915 ng Ph\u7847 n
\f1\b0 . H\uc0\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Quy\u7873 n S\u7917  D\u7909 ng n\'e0y \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u273 i\u7873 u ch\u7881 nh v\'e0 gi\u7843 i th\'edch theo lu\u7853 t c\u7911 a Ti\u7875 u Bang California, ngo\u7841 i tr\u7915  c\'e1c nguy\'ean t\u7855 c v\u7873  xung \u273 \u7897 t ph\'e1p lu\u7853 t. H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Quy\u7873 n S\u7917  D\u7909 ng n\'e0y s\u7869  kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u273 i\u7873 u ch\u7881 nh theo C\'f4ng \u431 \u7899 c Li\'ean H\u7907 p Qu\u7889 c v\u7873  H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng Mua B\'e1n H\'e0ng H\'f3a Qu\u7889 c T\u7871 . Vi\u7879 c \'e1p d\u7909 ng C\'f4ng \u431 \u7899 c n\'e0y b\u7883  lo\u7841 i tr\u7915  r\'f5 r\'e0ng. N\u7871 u b\u7841 n l\'e0 ng\u432 \u7901 i ti\'eau d\'f9ng t\u7841 i V\u432 \u417 ng Qu\u7889 c Anh th\'ec H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Quy\u7873 n S\u7917  D\u7909 ng n\'e0y s\u7869  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u273 i\u7873 u ch\u7881 nh theo lu\u7853 t t\u7841 i khu v\u7921 c ph\'e1p l\'fd b\u7841 n c\u432  tr\'fa. N\u7871 u v\'ec m\u7897 t l\'fd do n\'e0o \u273 \'f3 m\'e0 t\'f2a \'e1n c\'f3 th\u7849 m quy\u7873 n th\u7845 y r\u7857 ng b\u7845 t k\u7923  quy \u273 \u7883 nh ho\u7863 c ph\u7847 n n\'e0o trong H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Quy\u7873 n S\u7917  D\u7909 ng n\'e0y kh\'f4ng th\u7875  th\u7921 c thi th\'ec ph\u7847 n c\'f2n l\u7841 i c\u7911 a H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Quy\u7873 n S\u7917  D\u7909 ng n\'e0y v\u7851 n ti\u7871 p t\u7909 c c\'f3 hi\u7879 u l\u7921 c \u273 \u7847 y \u273 \u7911 .\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\
\

\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 13. To\'e0n B\uc0\u7897  H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng; Ng\'f4n Ng\u7919  \u272 i\u7873 u Ch\u7881 nh.
\f1\b0  H\uc0\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Quy\u7873 n S\u7917  D\u7909 ng n\'e0y t\u7841 o th\'e0nh to\'e0n b\u7897  th\u7887 a thu\u7853 n gi\u7919 a b\u7841 n v\'e0 Apple li\'ean quan \u273 \u7871 n Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple v\'e0 s\u7869  thay th\u7871  to\'e0n b\u7897  c\'e1c th\u7887 a thu\u7853 n v\u7873  v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873  n\'e0y tr\u432 \u7899 c \u273 \'f3 ho\u7863 c t\u7841 i c\'f9ng th\u7901 i \u273 i\u7875 m. B\u7845 t k\u7923  s\u7917 a ch\u7919 a ho\u7863 c thay \u273 \u7893 i n\'e0o c\u7911 a H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Quy\u7873 n S\u7917  D\u7909 ng n\'e0y s\u7869  kh\'f4ng c\'f3 gi\'e1 tr\u7883  r\'e0ng bu\u7897 c, tr\u7915  phi s\u7917 a ch\u7919 a ho\u7863 c thay \u273 \u7893 i \u273 \'f3 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c l\u7853 p th\'e0nh v\u259 n b\u7843 n v\'e0 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c Apple k\'fd. Vi\u7879 c d\u7883 ch H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Quy\u7873 n S\u7917  D\u7909 ng n\'e0y \u273 \u432 \u7907 c th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n \u273 \u7875  \u273 \'e1p \u7913 ng y\'eau c\u7847 u c\u7911 a qu\u7889 c gia s\u7903  t\u7841 i. Trong tr\u432 \u7901 ng h\u7907 p c\'f3 m\'e2u thu\u7851 n gi\u7919 a b\u7843 n ti\u7871 ng Anh v\'e0 b\u7843 n kh\'f4ng ph\u7843 i b\u7857 ng ti\u7871 ng Anh, b\u7843 n ti\u7871 ng Anh c\u7911 a H\u7907 p \u272 \u7891 ng C\u7845 p Quy\u7873 n S\u7917  D\u7909 ng n\'e0y s\u7869  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u432 u ti\'ean, trong ph\u7841 m vi ph\'e1p lu\u7853 t t\u7841 i khu v\u7921 c ph\'e1p l\'fd c\u7911 a b\u7841 n kh\'f4ng c\u7845 m.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\
