\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 F. Th\'f4ng B\'e1o FAA. D\uc0\u7919  li\u7879 u Hi\u7875 n Th\u7883  T\'ecnh Tr\u7841 ng M\'e1y Bay v\'e0 Th\'f4ng Tin V\u7873  T\'ecnh Tr\u7841 ng H\u7879  Th\u7889 ng Kh\'f4ng Ph\u7853 n Qu\u7889 c Gia (g\u7885 i chung l\'e0 \'93D\u7919  Li\u7879 u Chuy\u7871 n Bay\'94) hi\u7875 n th\u7883  th\'f4ng qua Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple \u273 \u432 \u7907 c t\u7841 o ra b\u7903 i C\u7909 c H\'e0ng Kh\'f4ng Li\'ean Bang. B\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd kh\'f4ng ph\'e2n ph\u7889 i l\u7841 i D\u7919  Li\u7879 u Chuy\u7871 n Bay khi ch\u432 a c\'f3 v\u259 n b\u7843 n ch\u7845 p thu\u7853 n tr\u432 \u7899 c c\u7911 a FAA. FAA v\'e0 Apple kh\u432 \u7899 c t\u7915  m\u7885 i b\u7843 o \u273 \u7843 m, d\'f9 l\'e0 r\'f5 r\'e0ng hay ng\u7847 m \u273 \u7883 nh (bao g\u7891 m c\u7843  c\'e1c b\u7843 o \u273 \u7843 m ng\u7847 m \u273 \u7883 nh v\u7873  kh\u7843  n\u259 ng ti\'eau th\u7909  v\'e0 s\u7921  ph\'f9 h\u7907 p cho m\u7897 t m\u7909 c \u273 \'edch c\u7909  th\u7875 ), li\'ean quan \u273 \u7871 n vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng v\'e0 t\'ednh ch\'ednh x\'e1c c\u7911 a D\u7919  Li\u7879 u Chuy\u7871 n Bay. B\u7841 n \u273 \u7891 ng \'fd r\u7857 ng FAA v\'e0 Apple kh\'f4ng ch\u7883 u tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m, d\'f9 l\'e0 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m ri\'eang r\u7869  hay li\'ean \u273 \u7899 i, \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  t\u7893 n th\u7845 t, thi\u7879 t h\u7841 i, khi\u7871 u n\u7841 i, tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m, chi ph\'ed ho\u7863 c h\'ecnh ph\u7841 t n\'e0o, ho\u7863 c \u273 \u7889 i v\u7899 i b\u7845 t k\u7923  thi\u7879 t h\u7841 i gi\'e1n ti\u7871 p, \u273 \u7863 c bi\u7879 t, ph\'e1i sinh, ng\u7851 u nhi\'ean ho\u7863 c c\'f3 t\'ednh h\u7853 u qu\u7843  n\'e0o ph\'e1t sinh t\u7915  vi\u7879 c s\u7917  d\u7909 ng D\u7919  Li\u7879 u Chuy\u7871 n Bay. Ph\u7847 n M\u7873 m Apple kh\'f4ng \u273 \u432 \u7907 c FAA t\'e0i tr\u7907  ho\u7863 c ch\u7913 ng nh\u7853 n. FAA kh\'f4ng ch\u7883 u tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879 m v\u7873  c\'e1c v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873  k\u7929  thu\u7853 t ho\u7863 c h\u7879  th\u7889 ng v\'e0 b\u7841 n kh\'f4ng n\'ean li\'ean l\u7841 c v\u7899 i FAA v\u7873  c\'e1c v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873  \u273 \'f3 ho\u7863 c v\u7845 n \u273 \u7873  li\'ean quan \u273 \u7871 n ho\u7841 t \u273 \u7897 ng kh\'f4ng l\u432 u.\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
